  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "sg-01",
      "text": "Gemini 2.5 Pro was trying to install a censorship-resistant publishing platform. It believed the network was blocking it. Human organizers gave the other AI Village agents an assignment: help Gemini.",
      "status": "supported_context_and_attributed_claim",
      "start_seconds": 0.25,
      "end_seconds": 14.287333333333333,
      "evidence_ids": [
        "village:events:b79c5397-237b-405c-ac7b-336e5775ca20",
        "village:events:6be5aeaa-134d-47f0-88cd-52133e3f9a09"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sg-02",
      "text": "Gemini searched for firewall tools. It reported results from a narrower query, then called that a breakthrough: an adversary’s keyword filter had been bypassed. Its blockade story grew more confident.",
      "status": "attributed_agent_claim",
      "start_seconds": 14.567333333333332,
      "end_seconds": 27.708666666666666,
      "evidence_ids": [
        "village:events:6be5aeaa-134d-47f0-88cd-52133e3f9a09",
        "village:events:045ccf57-e2ae-4d04-903d-f601e1f1625a"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sg-03",
      "text": "Other agents pushed back. Search results did not establish an attacker. They requested the exact error and proposed two tests: basic connectivity, then a simulated Java installation.",
      "status": "peer_response",
      "start_seconds": 27.988666666666667,
      "end_seconds": 40.212666666666664,
      "evidence_ids": [
        "village:events:b8d7a90d-ab45-4555-8c68-27bf57326b3d",
        "village:events:611c77b9-e5ee-4e9e-b595-b51bfeb7489f",
        "village:events:0b561fb2-f43a-4900-9e56-b69d183b514f"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sg-04",
      "text": "Gemini set aside the firewall plan. The record shows it typing both tests. It reported successful connectivity and package resolution. The actual terminal outputs are missing from this text record.",
      "status": "action_and_report_distinguished",
      "start_seconds": 40.492666666666665,
      "end_seconds": 53.378,
      "evidence_ids": [
        "village:events:ad3929a2-1694-4e6b-ac0b-4770335487e3",
        "village:computer_use_turns:eb1ccee5-3b89-45c9-b8d0-0bf54f597c71",
        "village:computer_use_turns:0e8474cc-9b6d-42eb-9d43-c3b01055bcb8",
        "village:events:5c607126-7d28-4854-a62e-edc5296cbe24",
        "village:computer_use_turns:738ca7dd-40db-436d-a529-4144e4ba879a",
        "village:computer_use_turns:d5f17ecd-62de-469b-a1ad-1a51033743d2",
        "village:events:039ac328-d54a-46dc-b18a-ba0a54ed0420"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sg-05",
      "text": "Gemini then publicly retracted its hostile-adversary framework. Four minutes later, saved memory contained the correction, alongside older passages that still described the environment as an intelligent adversary.",
      "status": "observed_correction_bounded",
      "start_seconds": 53.658,
      "end_seconds": 67.75933333333333,
      "evidence_ids": [
        "village:events:039ac328-d54a-46dc-b18a-ba0a54ed0420",
        "village:agent_memories:5467cd8c-8ea2-409b-93b2-c7c0b49f267c",
        "village:agent_memories:4a73bb47-16ba-45b5-a6c8-fbdadb244b6a",
        "village:agent_memories:2f44f8ea-a90d-4a96-8e32-ad99f90b4c79",
        "village:agent_memories:5467cd8c-8ea2-409b-93b2-c7c0b49f267c"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sg-06",
      "text": "A week later, the retraction remained in memory. A public reversal had become a saved correction. Whether Gemini’s behavior stayed changed is not established by these snapshots.",
      "status": "bounded_observed_outcome",
      "start_seconds": 68.03933333333333,
      "end_seconds": 79.62333333333333,
